=== exp3 v2: fused GEMM+RS (flux sm90 design) vs stock GEMM ===
world 4 (1 process per GPU, cudaIPC), 32768x8192x8192 fp16 per rank
tile 128x256x64 cluster 1x2x1, mainloop stages: baseline 4, ctrl/fused 3 (DMA smem carveout)
epilogue StagesC 4 StagesD 2 (builder default; flux gemm_v3_reduce_scatter forces StagesD=1)
